Third-party components
----------------------

RookSac currently bundles no third-party source code, assets, datasets, or
model weights. If a component is added in a future release, its name, version,
source URL, license, and any required attribution or notice text will be listed
below this line.

Algorithms and ideas referenced from public computer-chess literature (Chess
Programming Wiki, public engine documentation) are used as learning references
only. No code was copied from those sources.

